WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.789 --> 00:00:03.083
♫ Hey

00:00:03.083 --> 00:00:06.067
♫ Time to stand together

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:08.984
♫ Like once before

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.781
♫ And this time we'll stop the war

00:00:13.781 --> 00:00:16.578
(speaking Arabic)

00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:20.159
♫ I'm in the magic business

00:00:20.159 --> 00:00:23.689
♫ The somewhat tragic business

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:25.295
- I'm from Saudi Arabia

00:00:25.295 --> 00:00:28.378
and I live in Los Angeles California.

00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:33.524
I love music because when I perform

00:00:33.524 --> 00:00:35.352
it feels so free.

00:00:35.352 --> 00:00:37.677
♫ He said he was a danger

00:00:37.677 --> 00:00:40.187
♫ He ruined his last name

00:00:40.187 --> 00:00:42.958
♫ His daughter she's a singer

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.751
♫ Put her family to shame.

00:00:45.751 --> 00:00:48.943
I grew up in a more
conservative society and

00:00:48.943 --> 00:00:52.650
music is not really seen as a career

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.567
from where I come from.

00:00:55.484 --> 00:00:58.704
It's scary you know, when you
put yourself out there and

00:00:58.704 --> 00:01:01.271
you come from a place
where it's not typical

00:01:01.271 --> 00:01:02.609
to put yourself out there,

00:01:02.609 --> 00:01:06.360
especially being a woman;
that's why I wrote Gender Game.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:10.527
♫ If I say my name or I show
my face I should be ashamed

00:01:11.643 --> 00:01:14.226
And so I see myself as a bridge

00:01:15.428 --> 00:01:18.148
between people's perceptions
of the Middle East

00:01:18.148 --> 00:01:20.777
and people's perceptions of the West.

00:01:20.777 --> 00:01:23.140
There are so many positive
things that are happening

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.702
in Saudi with women.

00:01:24.702 --> 00:01:27.677
Women can now vote in
the municipal elections.

00:01:27.677 --> 00:01:30.362
More women are working
and they're independent.

00:01:30.362 --> 00:01:33.402
Women can't drive yet, but I do have hope

00:01:33.402 --> 00:01:36.652
and I know that it's gonna happen soon.

00:01:38.278 --> 00:01:40.513
We need to remember that
when we're thinking about

00:01:40.513 --> 00:01:44.698
somebody else, when we don't
like what another culture

00:01:44.698 --> 00:01:47.689
is doing, we need to take
a step back and remember

00:01:47.689 --> 00:01:50.022
that we're all human beings.

